              <div style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: "#6b6b72", maxWidth: 380, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>The 3D configurator is served by Marucci's builder API and renders in this frame. Colors, text and options are its own; Team Stores only receives the finished spec.</div>
